---
title: Shortcrust Pastry
author: Shirley Simmonds
tags: vegetarian
servings: 1
yields: 275%g
prep time: 40 minutes
cook time: 0 minutes
---

Place @plain flour{175%g} and @butter{100%g}(cut into small cubes) in a bowl and rub together with your fingertips until the mixture resembles coarse breadcrumbs, working quickly to avoid warming the dough.

Add @water{2%tbsp} using a knife to mix it together, adding more a teaspoon at a time if required.

Wrap the dough in clingfilm and chill for ~{30%minutes}.

> If using as a pie crust, pre-bake for ~{10%minutes} at 200°C
